---
description: "Mermaid diagram guidance for complex flows"
globs:
  - "src/**"
autoAttach: true
---

When you detect loops, conditional branches, or event sequences in code:

1. Generate a **Mermaid** diagram block immediately under the related narrative.
2. Use clear node labels with function/class names.
3. Example:
   
   ```mermaid
   flowchart TD
     A[Start] --> B{Condition?}
     B -->|Yes| C[Do X]
     B -->|No| D[Do Y]
   ```